s able to deliver strong attacks, even though she is lacking in her defenses.<br><br><strong>Ursula</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/385260/extras/204648c1a232f2340c63c8f6b2c16417.avif?t=1790494544\" width=600 height=400 /></span><br><br>Ursula is a mage knowing many spells that can hinder numerous foes at once.<br><br><strong>Vivian</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/385260/extras/aa50101fbe354ddf20e57964897029d7.avif?t=1790494544\" width=640 height=426 /></span><br><br>Vivian wields a mighty bow that can hit any single target with an incredible power.",
